  triage:title "UnixListener/UnixStream imports in tests.rs not gated under #[cfg(unix)]" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/tests.rs:23 imports std::os::unix::net::{UnixListener, UnixStream} at module level with no #[cfg(unix)] gate. Lines 184-185 use these types directly. ADR-007 requires per-function unix gates; module-level ungated unix imports fail Windows compilation." ;
